<p>The installation team records the finished work with photos and serial numbers.</p>
<ol class="steps">
    <li>Open the project → <strong>Installation</strong> card.</li>
    <li>Upload: <strong>Panel photo</strong>, <strong>Net-meter agreement</strong>, <strong>Panel serial no. photo</strong>, and optionally an <strong>Inverter photo</strong>. The badges turn green as each is uploaded.</li>
    <li>Fill installation date, panel make, inverter make, inverter serial no. and panel serial nos. (one per line). Serials entered at dispatch are already filled in.</li>
    <li><span class="btnname">Installation completed</span>. The system refuses until the three required uploads are there.</li>
</ol>
<p>Next: subsidy customers go to <a href="<?= site_url('admin/manual/dcr') ?>">DCR &amp; installation submission</a>; others go straight to <a href="<?= site_url('admin/manual/eb') ?>">EB / net meter</a>.</p>
